    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/29b1d70761554d6b1043d7ae49a652c2.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/29b1d70761554d6b1043d7ae49a652c2.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/29b1d70761554d6b1043d7ae49a652c2.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Combat from a New Perspective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell Of War</strong> is a large-scale tactical game that combines the <strong>intensity of a first-person shooter</strong> with the <strong>depth of real-time strategy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin as the operator of a <strong>combat drone</strong> \u2014 the central command unit on the battlefield. Scout enemy positions, coordinate allied forces, call in artillery strikes, deploy minefields, and send infantry, vehicles, and FPV drones into battle.<br>You are the <strong>eyes</strong>, the <strong>brain</strong>, and the <strong>iron fist</strong> of the operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>when precision is needed \u2014 switch to direct control</strong>.<br>Lead an infantry squad, drive an armored vehicle, or manually guide a strike drone straight to its target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <strong>strategy meets action</strong> \u2014 <strong>control belongs to you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/d052903f68f761c4550b3ae801fc0bd3.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/d052903f68f761c4550b3ae801fc0bd3.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/d052903f68f761c4550b3ae801fc0bd3.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Artillery Strikes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark targets with <strong>meter-level precision</strong> \u2014 create fire barriers, destroy fortifications, and support your assaults.<br><strong>Artillery is your main tool</strong> of pressure, control, and battlefield dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/bbe259fdadc56bdd30aa3126e1b0222d.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/bbe259fdadc56bdd30aa3126e1b0222d.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/bbe259fdadc56bdd30aa3126e1b0222d.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infantry Command</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From drone mode, you set routes, define assault or defense zones, and coordinate unit movement.<br>Take direct control of an <strong>infantry commander</strong> to unlock <strong>full tactical control</strong> over your squad:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give real-time orders \u2014 assault, cover, hold, or flank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate in sync with vehicles, artillery, and drones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infantry is your flexible force.</strong><br><strong>Your tactics \u2014 their actions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/51cb18e77f801447f0fef363c8d52789.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/51cb18e77f801447f0fef363c8d52789.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/51cb18e77f801447f0fef363c8d52789.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/5096a4aedbdc039aa8b47127533c1c17.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/5096a4aedbdc039aa8b47127533c1c17.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/5096a4aedbdc039aa8b47127533c1c17.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vehicle Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the drone, direct <strong>vehicle routes</strong>, assign key positions, and coordinate fire support.<br>Your armor acts on your command \u2014 fast, precise, and powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when full control is needed \u2014 <strong>get behind the wheel</strong>.<br>Take aim, break enemy lines, and support your troops at the front.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles are your strike force.</strong><br>Use them as part of your <strong>grand strategy</strong> or your <strong>personal tool for victory</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/3e7c4847cdd05d5371421b65ae0600b0.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/3e7c4847cdd05d5371421b65ae0600b0.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/3e7c4847cdd05d5371421b65ae0600b0.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drone Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your primary drone is the central command unit \u2014 spotting enemies, coordinating troops, and guiding artillery fire.<br>In addition, you have access to multiple strike drone types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPV drones</strong> for targeted kamikaze attacks;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bombing drones</strong> with automatic or manually triggered payloads;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy assault drones</strong> with high-damage charges for destroying vehicles and fortifications.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drones give you mobility, surprise, and airborne power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/8af4c15033800554c3157a0a6b7f5ec6.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/8af4c15033800554c3157a0a6b7f5ec6.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/8af4c15033800554c3157a0a6b7f5ec6.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/38f0d3d68564c849340b3cd4c2982a67.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/38f0d3d68564c849340b3cd4c2982a67.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/38f0d3d68564c849340b3cd4c2982a67.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Command drone under your control</strong> \u2013 Scout the battlefield, mark enemy positions, call in artillery and minefields, and coordinate combat in real time.<br>\u2022 <strong>Full tactical control</strong> \u2013 Issue orders to infantry, vehicles, and drones. Form assault groups, plan flanking maneuvers, or defend key positions.<br>\u2022 <strong>Instant unit switching</strong> \u2013 Jump into the action by directly controlling infantry commanders, vehicles, or drones.<br>\u2022 <strong>Squad-based infantry tactics</strong> \u2013 Set positions from the drone; give squad commands via the commander: assault, hold, cover, or maneuver.<br>\u2022 <strong>Vehicle command</strong> \u2013 Deploy vehicles strategically or take direct control when needed.<br>\u2022 <strong>Diverse strike drones</strong> \u2013 FPV drones, bombing drones, and more. Choose your targets and execute precision attacks.<br>\u2022 <strong>Heavy fire support</strong> \u2013 Artillery strikes, mining zones, and other tactical tools to support both offense and defense.<br>\u2022 <strong>Intense FPS combat</strong> \u2013 Breach buildings, clear rooms, survive under fire \u2014 with realistic weapons and immersive visual style.<br>\u2022 <strong>Deep battlefield tactics</strong> \u2013 Synchronize your units, use terrain and cover, scout enemy movement, and control critical zones.<br>\u2022 <strong>Dynamic battlefield</strong> \u2013 Every moment matters. Losses, reinforcements, flanks \u2014 everything reacts to your decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your battlefield. Your strategy. Your war.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell Of War</strong> is not just a war game.<br>It\u2019s a battle where <strong>you are the commander, the fighter, and the scout \u2014 all at once</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every action matters.</strong><br><strong>Every decision changes the fight.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/29b1d70761554d6b1043d7ae49a652c2.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/29b1d70761554d6b1043d7ae49a652c2.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/29b1d70761554d6b1043d7ae49a652c2.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Combat from a New Perspective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell Of War</strong> is a large-scale tactical game that combines the <strong>intensity of a first-person shooter</strong> with the <strong>depth of real-time strategy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin as the operator of a <strong>combat drone</strong> \u2014 the central command unit on the battlefield. Scout enemy positions, coordinate allied forces, call in artillery strikes, deploy minefields, and send infantry, vehicles, and FPV drones into battle.<br>You are the <strong>eyes</strong>, the <strong>brain</strong>, and the <strong>iron fist</strong> of the operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>when precision is needed \u2014 switch to direct control</strong>.<br>Lead an infantry squad, drive an armored vehicle, or manually guide a strike drone straight to its target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <strong>strategy meets action</strong> \u2014 <strong>control belongs to you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/d052903f68f761c4550b3ae801fc0bd3.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 hei