rong>Your tactics \u2014 their actions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/51cb18e77f801447f0fef363c8d52789.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/51cb18e77f801447f0fef363c8d52789.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/51cb18e77f801447f0fef363c8d52789.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/5096a4aedbdc039aa8b47127533c1c17.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/5096a4aedbdc039aa8b47127533c1c17.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/5096a4aedbdc039aa8b47127533c1c17.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vehicle Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the drone, direct <strong>vehicle routes</strong>, assign key positions, and coordinate fire support.<br>Your armor acts on your command \u2014 fast, precise, and powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when full control is needed \u2014 <strong>get behind the wheel</strong>.<br>Take aim, break enemy lines, and support your troops at the front.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles are your strike force.</strong><br>Use them as part of your <strong>grand strategy</strong> or your <strong>personal tool for victory</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/3e7c4847cdd05d5371421b65ae0600b0.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/3e7c4847cdd05d5371421b65ae0600b0.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/3e7c4847cdd05d5371421b65ae0600b0.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drone Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your primary drone is the central command unit \u2014 spotting enemies, coordinating troops, and guiding artillery fire.<br>In addition, you have access to multiple strike drone types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPV drones</strong> for targeted kamikaze attacks;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bombing drones</strong> with automatic or manually triggered payloads;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy assault drones</strong> with high-damage charges for destroying vehicles and fortifications.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drones give you mobility, surprise, and airborne power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/8af4c15033800554c3157a0a6b7f5ec6.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/8af4c15033800554c3157a0a6b7f5ec6.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/8af4c15033800554c3157a0a6b7f5ec6.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/38f0d3d68564c849340b3cd4c2982a67.poster.avif?t=1755182956\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/38f0d3d68564c849340b3cd4c2982a67.webm?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602640/extras/38f0d3d68564c849340b3cd4c2982a67.mp4?t=1755182956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Command drone under your control</strong> \u2013 Scout the battlefield, mark enemy positions, call in artillery and minefields, and coordinate combat in real time.<br>\u2022 <strong>Full tactical control</strong> \u2013 Issue orders to infantry, vehicles, and drones. Form assault groups, plan flanking maneuvers, or defend key positions.<br>\u2022 <strong>Instant unit switching</strong> \u2013 Jump into the action by directly controlling infantry commanders, vehicles, or drones.<br>\u2022 <strong>Squad-based infantry tactics</strong> \u2013 Set positions from the drone; give squad commands via the commander: assault, hold, cover, or maneuver.<br>\u2022 <strong>Vehicle command</strong> \u2013 Deploy vehicles strategically or take direct control when needed.<br>\u2022 <strong>Diverse strike drones</strong> \u2013 FPV drones, bombing drones, and more. Choose your targets and execute precision attacks.<br>\u2022 <strong>Heavy fire support</strong> \u2013 Artillery strikes, mining zones, and other tactical tools to support both offense and defense.<br>\u2022 <strong>Intense FPS combat</strong> \u2013 Breach buildings, clear rooms, survive under fire \u2014 with realistic weapons and immersive visual style.<br>\u2022 <strong>Deep battlefield tactics</strong> \u2013 Synchronize your units, use terrain and cover, scout enemy movement, and control critical zones.<br>\u2022 <strong>Dynamic battlefield</strong> \u2013 Every moment matters. Losses, reinforcements, flanks \u2014 everything reacts to your decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your battlefield. Your strategy. Your war.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell Of War</strong> is not just a war game.<br>It\u2019s a battle where <strong>you are the commander, the fighter, and the scout \u2014 all at once</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every action matters.</strong><br><strong>Every decision changes the fight.</strong></p>",
